  "description": "A BenchmarkDotNet IDiagnoser for net8.0/net9.0/net10.0 benchmark projects that attaches the dotnet-diagnostics engine in-process to a benchmark's child process and captures EventPipe perf indicators (GC, contention, thread pool, exceptions, JIT, counters, …) as JSON artifacts plus a per-run \"biggest offenders\" report. Tag benchmark methods with [DiagnosticKind] and add [DotnetDiagnosticsDiagnoser] to the benchmark class.",
